<title>UK: BFI falls one point to 1,516 in slow conditions.</title>
<headline>BFI falls one point to 1,516 in slow conditions.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index (BFI) fell one point to 1,516 on Monday in extremely slow conditions.</p>
<p>The market was expected to remain dead for the remainder of the week because of holidays in Japan and South Korea. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 8057</p>
</text>
